{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10297730","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297730","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029773001:1":{"text":"저, 저는... 로완 도련님! 무슨 말씀이십니까? 저는...","source_cn":"我、我——罗万少爷，你在说什么，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x237A4B576EDCF422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029773002:0":{"text":"공금을 횡령하고 거래처에서 뇌물도 받았죠? 심지어 올해 계획까지 몰래 유출했다는 증거도 전부 여기 있어요!","source_cn":"你在暗中挪用公款，收受供货商的贿赂，私下泄露本年度的商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235A6235EFFA4C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029773003:0":{"text":"나, 난 억울해! 이 새파랗게 어린 꼬맹이가 우리 같은 고참들을 몰아내려고 수작질을...!","source_cn":"你这是栽赃嫁祸！你这个乳臭未干的小子，现在就想对我们这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x544DB40465B6E1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029773004:0":{"text":"먼저 손 댄건 당신이잖아요?","source_cn":"是你先出手的才对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6907178FA00EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029773005:0":{"text":"당신은 <style=\"highlight\">어떤 친구</style>의 손을 빌려서 용병을 고용해 몇 번이고 저를 해치려고 했으니까요.","source_cn":"你联络<style=highlight>某位朋友</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB838C845B201BA8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029773006:0":{"text":"관련 서류는 이미 기사단에 제출했어요. 그리고 당신이 직접 연락한 그 책임자는... 우리의 증인이 되겠죠.","source_cn":"相关的单据我已经提交给了骑士团，当然，也有你亲自与之联...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B68CC93E1BE519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029773007:0":{"text":"이, 이런 일에 기사단이 나설 리 없어! 이건 그냥 사업상의...","source_cn":"这、这、这点事骑士团不会管的吧，只是些生意上的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A1408004A91E995","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029773008:1":{"text":"아, 맞아요. 기사단은 대체로 횡령이나 뇌물, 부실 시공과 같은 상회 내부의 일에는 관여하지 않죠.","source_cn":"啊，没错——虽然骑士团通常不会负责贪污、吃回扣以及偷工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x853C1D9C823EDF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029773009:1":{"text":"하지만 이름난 신사이자 공주님의 약혼자를 여러 차례 노린 살인 계획은... 그냥 두고 볼 수 없죠. ","source_cn":"但数次买凶杀人，对象不仅是一位知名的绅士，更是公主殿下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC43AABEB1A3569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029773010:1":{"text":"아, 참고로 당신이 고용한 용병과 제공한 운송로, 그리고 무기 공급처까지 전부 저희 손에 들어왔답니다.","source_cn":"哦，捎带一提，你雇佣的佣兵，提供的运输，甚至连武器的供...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A664462E95A0EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029773011:1":{"text":"제가 지금 할 일이 많아서요. 그러니까 얌전히 구는 게 좋을...","source_cn":"现在我忙得焦头烂额，建议你老实一点，乖乖认——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2D3154C6F908E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029773012:1":{"text":"이 망할 놈들! 두고 봐라!","source_cn":"混账东西！你们给我走着瞧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x627122FAD6179BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平德":{"text":"핀드","source":"平德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}